  "details": "Since the latest update, my right controller is unable to interact with the menu after interacting with it with the left controller. I'm using Index controllers.\n\n1. Press B on any controller to open the menu\n\n2. Interact with the menu using left controller\n\n3. Try to use the menu with right controller\n\nCoincidentally, I've also had issues with my right controller only when trying to open the chatbox: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1533-open-chatbox-binding-broken",
